tools/_d4prof_b/
tools/_recon_prof*/
tools/_recon_prof2/
tools/_recon_prof3/
tools/_ref/
web/_reg_prof/
**/chrome-prof/
**/_reg_prof/
**/_chrome_tmp*/
*.dmp
# Local backup files (never committed)
*.bak_*
# --- Headless browser profile & one-off recon artefacts (2026-10-13) ---
